WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.520
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.110
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.990
I'm a second-year exchange student at the idol school, Venus Ark.{it's not really abroad, is it? (but we could say "studying aboard" if we felt like it)}

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.700
I work my hardest at my Aikatsu every day.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:24.040
Venus Ark appeared without warning.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:30.550
Its owner and top idol, Elza-san, sails the world scouting idols whose skills she deems worthy. {while it was true, the ken part is like &}

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.260
Exchange students?

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:39.010
No one can stop the desire to grow and mature. I know that better than anyone!

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:46.270
That's how me, Rola, and Mahiru-chan began our school exchange.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:48.690
And then...

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.110
Koharu-chan!

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:54.110
It's been far too long, Yume-chan, Rola, Mahiru-chan.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.660
Our life at Venus Ark started with a huge surprise!

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:05.210
I refuse to allow it to end like this.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.460
I'll reclaim it with my own two hands.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.800
To that end...

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.260
Venus Ark...

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:23.350
I'll send you to the bottom of the sea if that's what it takes.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.590
That's the spirit, Mahiru-chan.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.710
You're totally in the groove.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:22.760
Hasn't she just been leaping out of the frame since she joined S4?

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:23.970
She has.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.180
Thank you very much.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.060
<i>But I haven't matched Onee-chan yet.</i>

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:34.060
Excuse me, but if you could offer any kind of advice, I'd gladly take it.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.360
Well then, for instance...

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:39.240
The lighting.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.450
These babies are a model's greatest ally.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:45.620
Make them yours, and you'll shine like never before.{if you must the master, change "how to use them" to just "it" or something}

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.160
Lighting...

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:52.420
<i>Come to think of it, there are all sorts of different lighting used in photoshoots.</i>

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.630
<i>I haven't really thought about it before.</i>

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.670
Somber looks are no good. {of course I'd find a japanese person asking online if you can use this in english}{why is N エヌ and not エン}

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:02.550
Keep telling yourself how splendid 
you are, and one day you'll be right.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:06.180
Also, I believe you brought those shoes from home?

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.100
Oh, yes.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:12.020
I figured they would match today's coord better than the ones provided.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.060
I knew it.

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.560
The right and left are different heights.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:21.610
Concentrate on your posture whether you're standing or walking.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.950
If you correct your balance, your poses will be all the cleaner.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.580
Right!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:32.290
Okay! Let's keep all that in mind and move on to the next outfit!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.580
I will!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.710
We're good!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.420
Thank you!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:46.720
<i>The points from yesterday's fashion show got registered, so I rose to a higher rank.</i>

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.350
{I don't know whether I want them to stop or not}

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.350
<i>I inherited Romance Kiss from Onee-chan.</i>

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:59.230
<i>It's going to take a lot more work to me to keep it going.</i>

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:03.360
Hopefully I can gain some insight at Venus Ark.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.610
Right, did you hear?

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:09.120
That one idol still hasn't been heard from.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.990
Oh, you mean Shooting Star?

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:16.670
Yeah, I wish we could've done at least one special issue on them.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.630
Who's Shooting Star?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:23.340
There was a model who exploded onto the scene in New York not too long ago.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.260
They were a complete mystery, never even showing their face.

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:30.720
No one knew their name, nor even their gender.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:34.730
Everyone was convinced they'd be the next big thing.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.690
But one day, they simply disappeared.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:44.650
It was such a disappointment. 
I was itching to photograph them.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:49.700
One blinding flash of light and then back into the darkness, just like a shooting star.{how i shot star}

00:05:55.080 --> 00:06:01.000
And then, right when I was thinking I had to do something big for the new students,

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.420
Venus Ark came out of nowhere.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:09.930
Elza-san waltzed right into Four Star Academy and insulted Rola without ever having seen her perform.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.260
I couldn't help myself and—

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:15.060
Let her have it, right? Elza-sama told me. {In one sentence, this makes sense, but does it like this?}{it seems to do}

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.180
Huh?! Was she actually mad?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:19.850
No, she said you were interesting.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.320
Is that a complement?

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:27.490
Geez, Perfect Elza flatters me.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.910
Yume, you're in her personal space.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.450
Sorry! I've just been going on about myself.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:34.740
I don't mind.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.830
It's Yume-chan.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.500
It's Koharu-chan.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.380
So tell us about you, Koharu.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.840
How has Venus Ark been?

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:50.800
Yeah, I wanna know too!

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:57.060
That donut! No—

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.100
Koharu-chan gave that to me!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.480
Give it back!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.020
Wait, Yume!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.400
Wait!

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:16.990
So you're not gonna let Yume-chan and them just finish their exchange program and leave?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.120
Naturally.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:25.670
Yume is a vital piece of my plan to lure Hime to Venus Ark.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.630
And it's not simply the two of them I desire.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:40.480
Your second serving is Tajima beef, 
from whence all Japanese steak derives.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.810
Thank you.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.230
I will take in every perfect idol

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.610
without leaving a single scrap behind.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.630
Hold it!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:15.760
Come back, you!

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.220
What? Hey, Yume!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.730
Hey!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.650
Stop!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:28.940
What?!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.610
Pardon me.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.070
Rei-san?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.830
Stop!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.670
<i>That stance...</i>

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.150
You should know better, Miranda.

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:15.570
A proper lady never takes a visitor's snack.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.450
Rei-senpai.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.080
Sorry. I apologize on her behalf.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:27.080
Would you forgive her? She's something like this ship's guardian spirit.

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:30.840
Welcome party?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.340
Yes, Elza wishes to welcome you with a performance.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:40.180
Welcome? We're just here on exchange from Four Star Academy.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.890
We haven't transferred in.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:46.100
That doesn't make you any less a member of Venus Ark.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.270
They threw me one too.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.900
The chef'll prepare you the finest food from around the globe.

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.900
They'll make us a feast, Rola!

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.740
This girl...

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:04.410
The way you wielded that deck brush was reminiscent of kendo.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.330
You have a sharp eye.

00:10:06.330 --> 00:10:09.460
As you said, it was kendo.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:14.210
Rei-senpai was born in America, 
but she's a kendo master.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.300
Kendo knows neither country nor border.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:23.350
With its roots in samurai and Zen, it is a path that leads one to a deep understanding of the soul.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:27.850
There is no greater martial art than kendo anywhere in the world.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.110
Hold it, I can't let that go unchallenged.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:31.860
Mahiru-chan?

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:46.500
The greatest martial art in the world is obviously karate.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:51.130
Forsaking the use of tools and utilizing every inch of one's own body,

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.960
it grants a mastery of oneself and unlimited potential for growth.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.260
It is the quintessential martial art!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:02.010
The shinai is no mere tool—it is a blade. {hm, I wonder if shinai is common. then I could use sword later. also I wish there was more bamboo blade}{it's... probably common enough}

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:07.390
That blade is pointed not simply at the opponent, but at oneself.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:12.230
By honing the body and mind, 
one can objectively view oneself.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.360
Kendo is the best!

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:15.900
Karate is the best!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.030
Kendo is.

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:17.820
Karate.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:18.530
Kendo.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.240
Karate!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:19.900
Kendo!

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:20.780
Karate!

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:28.450
Excuse me for acting so unseemly.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:35.590
If we had simply begun with a direct battle, 
there would have been no need to argue with a lady.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:40.260
Interesting. I'll take you on.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:53.190
Huh? Rei-senpai is?

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:56.770
Yeah, she's going to fight one of the girls from Four Star.

00:11:56.770 --> 00:11:58.860
Really? Let's go watch!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:10.080
I expect a fair and proper fight upholding the principles of good sportsmanship.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.120
On my mark.

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.830
Begin!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.380
Intruder detected.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.130
I repeat: intruder detected.{I would eek consider a comma}

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:25.640
Students are to return to their quarters until further notice.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.390
All deckhands are to capture the intruder.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.560
I repeat: an intruder has been detected on board.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.890
An intruder?

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:38.650
Everyone, please return to your rooms at once in an orderly manner!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:41.400
Rei-sama, Mahiru-sama, you as well.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.860
No, I'll help search for the intruder.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.740
It is too dangerous!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.240
You should be well aware of my kendo abilities.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:50.740
Then I'll go too!

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:51.870
You mustn't...

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.370
Very well.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:55.540
Our match will have to wait.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:10.760
Go, go, go!

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:24.530
I don't see them around here.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:27.360
Let's search upstairs next. This way.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:28.700
Wait—

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.830
Ow...

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:36.460
Are you okay?

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.420
Yes, thankfully.

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:41.960
You tripped because you fell off balance.

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:46.430
Keep it to yourself. I have no need for your kendo teachings.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:50.550
Your right and left shoes are different heights.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:51.260
Huh?

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.600
<i>The right and left are different heights.</i>

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:57.900
If you correct your balance, 
your poses will be all the cleaner.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:03.190
<i>That's the modeling advice I heard at the photoshoot.</i>

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.130
Hold it!

00:14:21.130 --> 00:14:22.380
Hey!

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:33.850
It's too dark to see.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:41.650
Lighting is your greatest ally.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.400
Make it yours!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.860
<i>That advice too...</i>

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.450
<i>Make the lighting yours...</i>

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.070
That's it!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.960
There!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.260
Heading your way!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.640
Oh no!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:21.650
I've got this.

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:31.910
Ako?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:38.830
I hope Mahiru-chan is all right.

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.250
Ako-chan?

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:43.670
Koharu?!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.210
I missed you!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.590
How have you been?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.420
Great! And you?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.510
If you took her energy away, what would be left?

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.430
Quite a bit, thank you!

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.560
But Koharu, why are you here?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.430
I think you should answer that yourself first.

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:05.770
Seems like she came to find Hanazono Kirara's weakness to take the position of FuwaFuwa Dream's muse.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:09.650
That doesn't mean she had to swim here.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.700
Ako-chan, you're here!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.780
Well? Well? Did you find my weakness?

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:19.700
You're so scary!

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.540
Get out of here!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.460
No, I don't wanna.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.660
Ako-chan's as cute as ever.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:28.460
Everyone from Four Star Academy, welcome to Venus Ark!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:39.260
This is a traditional roast pork dish from Denmark, flæskesteg.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.560
I've never seen dishes like these!

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.480
I'm glad you like it, Yume-chan.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:51.570
<i>Judging by Rei-san's advice, is she one too?</i>

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.490
Sorry about earlier.

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.860
I got a little stubborn.

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:58.120
No, I should apologize too.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:02.160
That aside, your movements were truly magnificent.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:04.120
I hope we can resume our bout one day.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:06.330
Say—

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:10.380
It's almost time for the party's 
main event, Elza's performance.

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:15.260
I must go to be at her side. If you'll excuse me.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:25.890
As Elza-sama's secretary, Rei-sama must attend to her needs.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.520
For now...

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.650
For now?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:38.910
Every Star Premium Rare Coord belongs at my side.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.140
For I am perfect!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.690
She's amazing every time.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:05.530
I hate to say it, but she's perfect.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:09.030
Not to mention her Blooming Queen Coord.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:09.700
Yes.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:16.420
That Premium Rare Dress blooms like a beautiful flowerbed, fit for a queen.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:22.840
And Koharu's helping Elza-sama out with designs for her brand!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.220
What?!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.220
For Perfect Queen?

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:31.970
Elza-sama recognized Koharu's perfect passion for design.

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.730
That's amazing, Koharu-chan!

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:37.100
No, I've barely done anything so far.

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:39.360
<i>Besides...</i>

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:42.980
<i>My dream lies with Yume-chan.</i>

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:44.360
Koharu-chan?

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:46.490
No, it's nothing.

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:52.160
All right, I won't be behind for long!

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:57.420
I'll get my own Star Premium Rare Coord 
and reach the top of the Aikatsu Ranking!

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:01.630
Enter.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:06.170
Forgive me, finishing everything up took longer than expected.

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:08.970
You were perfect again today.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:14.470
You should stop binding yourself to me and do what you want as well.

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:18.650
I'm here for you, Elza.

00:23:56.450 --> 00:24:02.500
You're the only person in the whole world who can wear the Venus Star Premium Rare Coord perfectly, Elza-sama!

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:09.340
That's right. This Blooming Queen Coord will take me to the number one spot of the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:14.010
This beautiful weather is perfect for outside work.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:16.140
Let Kirara come too!

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.010
I've got a bad feeling about this!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:19.810
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:22.140
Sparklies! Strolling Weather.

00:24:22.140 --> 00:24:24.310
Become the first-star idol!
